WEBVTT

00:00.390 --> 00:05.020
To all of my fans out there:
I know you've been waiting patiently.

00:05.020 --> 00:07.190
"When's she going to transform?"

00:07.190 --> 00:09.730
"Maybe she's just a wannabe in a costume."

00:09.730 --> 00:11.610
"The opening's a trick, idiots!"

00:11.610 --> 00:15.370
Well, guess what? Those boring days are over!

00:15.370 --> 00:16.200
That's right!

00:16.200 --> 00:19.910
Finally, I'm an exorcist girl, too!

00:19.910 --> 00:23.330
More accurately, I've been one all along!

00:23.330 --> 00:25.540
Go on, gaze at my greatness!

00:26.040 --> 00:27.540
Look! Look!

00:27.540 --> 00:28.590
Seriously, look!

00:31.920 --> 00:34.540
Huh? Wh-Where are you going?

00:34.540 --> 00:37.390
I went through a lotta trouble getting my powers.

00:38.180 --> 00:40.270
But look!

00:41.510 --> 00:42.680
Heck yeah!

00:47.360 --> 00:48.440
Guys,

00:48.440 --> 00:50.500
let me introduce you.

00:50.940 --> 00:55.450
These are my gods, Kuu-san and Kai-san.

00:55.450 --> 00:59.120
You've probably all gathered by now that Toi-san doesn't give a crap about being an exorcist girl,

00:59.120 --> 01:03.710
so I'll defeat the demons and keep the peace instead!

01:03.710 --> 01:05.830
Look forward to that.

01:05.830 --> 01:06.540
Oh, yeah.

01:06.540 --> 01:09.090
While we're at it, let's get rid of that <i>old</i> title.

01:09.090 --> 01:10.000
Now it'll be...

02:41.670 --> 02:44.010
She's getting really carried away.

02:49.730 --> 02:51.060
What?

02:52.520 --> 02:56.530
You're aligned with higher
dimensional beings, Yuma-san?

02:56.530 --> 02:59.780
And Matoi-san, you can see them?

03:00.530 --> 03:02.070
Yes, I can see them.

03:02.070 --> 03:04.870
A little boy and a little girl god.

03:04.870 --> 03:08.160
The fox's name is Kuu-san and the tanuki's is Kai-san.

03:08.160 --> 03:09.870
What do you think? Awesome, eh?

03:09.870 --> 03:11.500
Yes, very much so!

03:11.500 --> 03:13.040
Just like the mysteries of the orient!

03:13.040 --> 03:14.000
Right?

03:14.000 --> 03:15.800
I knew there was value in coming to Japan!

03:15.800 --> 03:17.260
Right? Right?

03:17.260 --> 03:19.260
<i>Is she aligned with </i>both<i> of them?</i>

03:19.260 --> 03:22.090
<i>Or are they one being in two bodies?</i>

03:22.090 --> 03:23.500
<i>Either way,</i>

03:23.500 --> 03:26.600
<i>the sacred treasure they had shown me had already been used to summon one.</i>

03:26.600 --> 03:28.430
<i>There was no power left within.</i>

03:28.930 --> 03:31.390
<i>That was why my sensors gave me no reading.</i>

03:31.690 --> 03:35.690
<i>To think that two people capable of
Divine Union would appear at the same time.</i>

03:36.070 --> 03:37.360
<i>It can't be a coincidence.</i>

03:37.360 --> 03:38.780
Luciela-sensei!

03:38.780 --> 03:40.320
Wh-What is it?

03:40.320 --> 03:41.650
Ta-da!

03:41.650 --> 03:42.950
Look!

03:42.950 --> 03:45.910
I made a twitter to advertise myself as an exorcist girl too!

03:45.910 --> 03:47.370
When did you do that!?

03:48.580 --> 03:51.330
Whoa, somebody's already requesting the services of yours truly!

03:53.750 --> 03:58.710
She says her shoulders got heavy out of nowhere!

03:58.710 --> 04:01.220
It's gotta be some kind of demonic possession!

04:01.220 --> 04:03.260
Her shoulders are probably just stiff.

04:03.260 --> 04:06.100
Hold on, that's the same girl who tweeted me!

04:06.510 --> 04:07.680
All right!

04:07.680 --> 04:09.520
Time to get to work!

04:09.520 --> 04:11.520
Just you wait, Morita-san!

04:11.520 --> 04:13.850
I'm on my way!

04:13.850 --> 04:15.440
Wait! Yuma-chan!

04:15.440 --> 04:16.860
You've got this all wrong!

04:16.860 --> 04:19.360
Really, really wrong!

04:30.040 --> 04:32.150
Yuma-chan, wait!

04:32.150 --> 04:34.210
A second girl capable of Divine Union appears,

04:34.210 --> 04:37.000
and she's aligned with not one,
but two higher dimensional beings?

04:37.000 --> 04:38.540
How should I handle it?

04:38.540 --> 04:42.050
Consider Kusanagi Yuma under your surveillance as well.

04:42.050 --> 04:43.130
Understood.

04:45.050 --> 04:49.100
<i>But if the Nights were bold enough to dispatch the Creed Killer,</i>

04:49.100 --> 04:52.270
<i>why have things been so quiet since?</i>

04:52.270 --> 04:55.520
<i>Weren't they after Sumeragi Matoi's Regalia?</i>

04:56.190 --> 04:57.300
<i>Or...</i>

04:57.650 --> 04:59.980
<i>Perhaps they had a different objective.</i>

05:01.110 --> 05:02.610
I'm Sorry!

05:10.620 --> 05:15.290
Seriously, menopause? I can't believe Morita-san tweeted me for that.

05:15.290 --> 05:18.130
I told you there weren't any demons involved!

05:21.590 --> 05:24.510
Heckin' yeah, a new request!

05:24.510 --> 05:25.510
This'll be the one!

05:25.510 --> 05:26.800
Yuma-chan!

05:26.800 --> 05:29.800
We're going to build a house,
so we wanted to ask for an exorcism first.

05:29.800 --> 05:32.060
That's the wrong kind of exorcism!

05:32.060 --> 05:34.430
Contact Tenman Shrine to do your groundbreaking ceremonies!

05:34.430 --> 05:35.980
Yuma-chan!

05:38.230 --> 05:40.110
There's nothing here, right?

05:40.110 --> 05:41.690
It's just a graveyard.

05:42.650 --> 05:43.730
A UFO?

05:43.730 --> 05:44.530
Where, where?

05:44.530 --> 05:46.490
Aliens are out of my jurisdiction!

05:47.450 --> 05:50.370
Wow, it's an exorcist girl!

05:50.370 --> 05:51.620
Can I get an autograph?

05:51.620 --> 05:53.870
Okay, okay, everyone! Line up, now!

05:53.870 --> 05:57.370
Wait, that's not what the request button is for!

06:01.880 --> 06:04.380
Yes, this is the Kamaya Station Violent Crimes Division.

06:05.300 --> 06:06.130
Huh?

06:06.130 --> 06:09.890
There's a ghost possessing a mascot costume in the shopping district?

06:09.890 --> 06:11.140
Come on now, ma'am.

06:11.140 --> 06:14.470
With all due respect, that's not a police problem.

06:13.390 --> 06:14.470
Man,

06:14.470 --> 06:15.930
it's so quiet around here.

06:16.600 --> 06:18.230
Quit slacking off, Poochi.

06:18.230 --> 06:19.730
Y-Yes, sir! Sorry, sir!

06:24.400 --> 06:26.610
<i>that girl... from before.</i>

06:33.620 --> 06:35.540
Harajuku Station?

06:35.540 --> 06:38.580
This is Sergeant Sumeragi from
the Kamaya Station Violent Crimes Division.

06:42.340 --> 06:44.460
I've never seen her so down.

06:44.460 --> 06:45.460
It's no surprise.

06:45.960 --> 06:47.300
Clarus-san!

06:47.300 --> 06:50.930
Incidents involving Nights are rare.

06:51.140 --> 06:55.680
Then how did I get mixed up with three of them in one week!?

06:55.680 --> 06:57.180
You're unique.

06:57.180 --> 06:58.060
Just accept it.

06:58.640 --> 07:01.270
But I wanna be normal!

07:03.650 --> 07:07.070
Cheer up, Yuma-chan. A lack of demons is proof that the world is at peace—

07:07.070 --> 07:08.360
There's one!

07:08.360 --> 07:10.400
I got another request!

07:10.950 --> 07:11.820
Look!

07:12.110 --> 07:16.120
He says there's a ghost possessing Kamakichi in the shopping district

07:16.120 --> 07:18.200
and he wants you to exorcise it.

07:18.700 --> 07:20.160
Who's Kamakichi?

07:20.160 --> 07:22.500
Kamaya City's local mascot.

07:22.500 --> 07:25.960
I guess the tweet is talking about the costumes you can buy.

07:26.340 --> 07:28.420
He'd gotten so popular that people wanted costumes made,

07:28.420 --> 07:31.730
but they never sold well because they look weird.

07:32.010 --> 07:34.510
I wonder if this person is telling the truth.

07:34.510 --> 07:38.520
There are no signs of a Gate of Caelum
opening in the past few days.

07:38.520 --> 07:44.440
But it's possible a Night possessed the person in the costume before I arrived in this country.

07:45.020 --> 07:46.690
Toi-san! Clarus-san!

07:46.690 --> 07:49.150
It's time for the Exorcist Girls to shine!

07:49.150 --> 07:50.950
When did I join your group!?

07:50.950 --> 07:52.150
I'm a member too?

07:52.780 --> 07:55.320
Who cares! Let's go check Kamakichi out.

07:55.320 --> 07:58.660
Once we're there, we'll be able to tell right away if this is the work of a demon.

07:58.660 --> 08:00.710
Seeing is believing!

08:00.710 --> 08:01.830
What?

08:01.830 --> 08:04.920
Oi, Toi-san! Wipe that frown off your face!

08:04.920 --> 08:07.420
We're the Exorcist Girls!
Don't you have a sense of duty!?

08:07.420 --> 08:08.670
No. Not at all.

08:08.670 --> 08:09.510
Me neither.

08:11.260 --> 08:14.510
Fine. I'll go check Kamakichi out on my own!

08:14.800 --> 08:17.970
Come on, Kuu-san, Kai-san.
It's time to get to work!

08:20.640 --> 08:21.980
What's this?

08:21.980 --> 08:24.100
Don't you want to go?

08:24.770 --> 08:26.650
Are you scared?

08:29.940 --> 08:32.320
You're supposed to be my partner!

08:32.320 --> 08:33.990
And you still call yourself a man!?

08:33.990 --> 08:35.070
He's a god, not a man.

08:35.070 --> 08:36.870
Technically, it's a higher dimensional being.

08:36.870 --> 08:37.910
Shut up!

08:38.240 --> 08:40.950
I'll drag him there if I have to!

08:40.950 --> 08:45.880
Nothing will ruin my beautiful debut as an exorcist girl!

08:45.880 --> 08:47.040
What should we do?

08:48.290 --> 08:50.300
Well, we can't just abandon her.

08:56.390 --> 08:58.470
Kamakichi isn't here.

08:58.470 --> 09:00.850
But he's always at this shopping district!

09:00.850 --> 09:01.970
Heh.

09:01.970 --> 09:06.100
He must have sensed my tremendous exorcist powers and booked it!

09:06.100 --> 09:07.690
What are you talking about?

09:07.690 --> 09:10.190
You've never exorcised anything.

09:10.440 --> 09:14.070
Must be nice, Toi-san.
You exorcise things all the time.

09:14.070 --> 09:16.910
That's why there was a huge picture of you in this morning's paper.

09:16.910 --> 09:20.000
Don't remind me! 😭

09:21.950 --> 09:23.500
Cute.

09:26.150 --> 09:28.100
Ah, so cute!

09:28.100 --> 09:29.420
It's amazing, Toi-san!

09:29.420 --> 09:32.000
He's a hundred times cuter than Kamakichi!

09:33.800 --> 09:35.260
Cute!

09:35.260 --> 09:38.300
He's wiggling his butt!
He's wiggling his butt, Toi!

09:40.550 --> 09:42.980
Too cute!

09:42.980 --> 09:46.020
He's showing his belly!
He's showing his belly, Toi-san!

09:47.980 --> 09:51.480
He's floating! He's floating, Toi-san!

09:51.480 --> 09:53.030
Hang on, Yuma-chan.

09:53.030 --> 09:54.000
What is it?

09:58.860 --> 10:00.950
K-Kamakichi...

10:00.950 --> 10:02.830
Which means...

10:03.490 --> 10:04.950
It's a Night!

10:04.900 --> 10:06.910
It's a demon!

10:11.710 --> 10:12.630
What?

10:12.630 --> 10:14.420
You've found a Night?

10:14.420 --> 10:16.130
Permission to use my Regalia?

10:16.130 --> 10:17.170
Granted.

10:17.170 --> 10:18.590
Find out its objective if possible.

10:18.840 --> 10:20.800
Impossible. It only says "Mokyu!"

10:21.170 --> 10:22.010
"Mokyu"?

10:22.010 --> 10:23.760
Yes, "Mokyu."

10:25.430 --> 10:26.680
Exterminate it.

10:26.680 --> 10:27.630
Roger.

10:28.390 --> 10:29.970
I've been granted permission to fight.

10:29.970 --> 10:33.270
Toi-san! Now is the time to fulfill the mission of the Exorcist Girls!

10:33.270 --> 10:35.520
But I never accepted any mission!

10:35.520 --> 10:36.900
Don't worry!

10:36.900 --> 10:41.150
I've packed us both some clothes just in case.

10:41.150 --> 10:43.280
How did you get my—

10:43.280 --> 10:46.450
Hey! You let yourself in my house again, didn't you!?

10:46.450 --> 10:48.200
Landlord's privilege.

10:48.200 --> 10:50.660
You're just a tyrant!

10:50.660 --> 10:53.210
You two are inexperienced and should stay out of this.

10:53.210 --> 10:54.710
I'll handle it.

10:57.170 --> 10:58.040
Come.

10:58.670 --> 11:01.050
System halt. Status: unconfined.

11:04.300 --> 11:05.180
Divine Union.

11:14.940 --> 11:17.650
Dimensional Transformation: Level 3.

11:19.400 --> 11:21.230
Clarus-san, the pro!

11:21.230 --> 11:23.240
Beautiful! Wonderful!

11:23.240 --> 11:25.410
But my transformation sequence will be even better than yours!

11:25.410 --> 11:27.120
Were you even listening?

11:28.700 --> 11:30.120
Demons begone!

11:30.120 --> 11:33.370
Photogenic Plasma Illusion!

11:36.040 --> 11:38.290
No! Why!?

11:40.500 --> 11:43.210
Y-You're going to fight in public!?

11:45.930 --> 11:48.300
I'll take the Night to a higher
dimension and defeat it there.

11:49.010 --> 11:50.760
Transformation: Level 4.

11:54.930 --> 11:57.270
You two stay here.

11:57.270 --> 11:59.610
I-It's a movie! We're shooting a movie!

11:57.650 --> 11:59.610
That chick just disappeared!

11:59.610 --> 12:00.690
Right, Yuma-chan?

12:01.770 --> 12:02.650
Huh?

12:02.650 --> 12:03.650
Yuma-chan?

12:07.900 --> 12:09.280
You won't get away from me!

12:09.280 --> 12:11.440
Prepare yourself!

12:11.440 --> 12:12.490
You!

12:13.450 --> 12:16.580
Can you start calling me Yuma already?

12:16.580 --> 12:17.710
Stay back.

12:19.790 --> 12:21.340
Come on, let's make ourselves—

12:21.750 --> 12:23.800
useless, I guess!

12:25.800 --> 12:27.130
I won't let you get away!

12:36.310 --> 12:39.230
I-It doesn't matter how cute you are!

12:43.480 --> 12:46.650
Oh! You did it, Clarus-san!

12:46.650 --> 12:47.700
Something's not right.

12:49.530 --> 12:51.160
That was <i>way</i> too easy.

13:06.340 --> 13:07.800
They're all so cute!

13:07.800 --> 13:08.470
It had friends?

13:15.390 --> 13:17.850
O-Okay, hang on!

13:22.230 --> 13:24.820
It got bigger!

13:43.380 --> 13:46.250
I wonder if they're doing okay without me?

13:46.250 --> 13:51.150
But the Night they're fighting today was tiny and cute, so they're probably fine.

13:51.150 --> 13:57.100
It's not as if that little guy's gonna spit out a bunch of his friends and merge into a giant, right?

14:05.940 --> 14:07.020
Was that an earthquake?

14:10.280 --> 14:12.450
What is that!? What's happening!?

14:12.700 --> 14:14.570
F-For now...

14:16.870 --> 14:18.080
Divine Union!

14:20.830 --> 14:23.000
Whoa, it's that Exorcist Girl everyone's talking about!

14:21.790 --> 14:24.790
Don't just take my picture!

14:26.750 --> 14:28.210
It's too big!

14:38.060 --> 14:39.270
Look out!

14:41.560 --> 14:42.850
Please let me make it!

14:47.650 --> 14:49.280
Hurry! Run!

14:49.280 --> 14:50.400
Hurry!

14:54.410 --> 14:55.660
Is that right?

14:55.870 --> 14:58.330
Thanks for the info.

14:59.620 --> 15:01.330
Yes. Goodbye.

15:02.620 --> 15:08.090
<i>Buildings have collapsed in the Kamaya Shopping District.</i>

15:06.170 --> 15:08.290
Buildings fell?

15:08.290 --> 15:09.300
Come on, Poochi.

15:09.300 --> 15:11.050
O-Okay!

15:15.430 --> 15:18.680
Th-This is a catastrophe!

15:18.680 --> 15:20.850
Clarus-san! Yuma-chan!

15:20.850 --> 15:22.230
What happened?

15:23.350 --> 15:25.770
Ugh, it got me all sticky. Gross.

15:25.770 --> 15:27.360
We can't let it hurt anyone else.

15:35.450 --> 15:36.860
I'll finish it in one attack!

15:43.180 --> 15:44.260
Wh-What the—

15:48.580 --> 15:49.840
Clarus-san!

15:50.540 --> 15:51.840
Are you okay?

15:56.430 --> 15:57.350
Run!

15:58.220 --> 16:00.000
A thin wall like this is nothing!

16:03.100 --> 16:04.560
In that case...

16:09.770 --> 16:11.070
No way.

16:18.450 --> 16:19.240
Yuma-chan!

16:27.420 --> 16:29.210
Another one fell!

16:29.210 --> 16:31.090
What the hell is going on?

16:31.090 --> 16:32.300
Ow...

16:32.300 --> 16:33.210
Yuma-chan!

16:33.210 --> 16:34.420
Toi-san!

16:34.420 --> 16:36.170
Run, Yuma-chan!

16:48.310 --> 16:51.110
Please! Lend me your power!

16:51.110 --> 16:52.520
I want to help Toi-san!

16:54.030 --> 16:57.320
Really? Why?

16:57.320 --> 16:58.530
Hey, wait!

17:04.660 --> 17:07.430
It's too dangerous for us to get closer.

17:07.830 --> 17:09.290
It's the same.

17:09.540 --> 17:13.040
The scale is different, but this is just like what happened yesterday in Harajuku.

17:16.050 --> 17:18.380
Clarus-san! If we don't move soon, we'll—

17:18.380 --> 17:19.590
I know!

17:20.970 --> 17:22.680
If only I could break this barrier!

17:29.810 --> 17:32.000
Shingo-san, thanks for everything.

17:43.910 --> 17:45.030
Yuma-chan!?

17:45.330 --> 17:47.500
What are you doing? You can't!

17:49.460 --> 17:50.830
Run, Yuma-chan!

17:51.210 --> 17:52.540
I can't!

17:52.540 --> 17:54.590
If I run away here...

17:54.590 --> 17:56.340
I'll never be an exorcist girl!

17:56.750 --> 17:58.840
I won't be able to protect everyone!

18:02.090 --> 18:03.260
So I...

18:05.820 --> 18:07.200
Hurry and run!

18:07.470 --> 18:08.430
So I...

18:08.430 --> 18:09.310
Yuma-chan!

18:49.140 --> 18:50.060
She achieved Divine Union...

18:56.020 --> 18:57.480
Thank you.

19:01.780 --> 19:03.400
Here I go!

19:12.000 --> 19:14.460
I see. My defense is impenetrable!

19:14.460 --> 19:15.250
But...

19:20.380 --> 19:22.670
Wow! What's this?

19:24.680 --> 19:26.090
Amazing!

19:26.090 --> 19:27.470
Here I go!

19:28.100 --> 19:30.350
Take that!

19:38.230 --> 19:40.410
Get 'em, Clarus-san!

19:47.070 --> 19:48.410
Mine own foe...

19:49.530 --> 19:52.410
without love, without mercy,
and without pity.

19:56.460 --> 19:58.670
Such a life leads down the path...

20:01.710 --> 20:02.920
of destruction!

20:14.810 --> 20:16.520
We did it!

20:16.520 --> 20:18.690
We did it, Toi-san!

20:18.690 --> 20:19.520
Yeah!

20:20.110 --> 20:22.110
Kai-san, Kuu-san!

20:22.110 --> 20:23.980
It's my first victory!

20:23.980 --> 20:26.200
Yay! Applause for me!

20:26.200 --> 20:29.780
I'm going to get out of here before I get drawn into a whole mess of trouble.

20:29.780 --> 20:31.970
You two should just pretend you got hurt or something.

20:33.910 --> 20:34.700
Also...

20:35.370 --> 20:39.670
I regret that my poor judgment was the cause of this.

20:40.500 --> 20:41.170
So...

20:43.750 --> 20:44.760
See you later.

20:47.840 --> 20:49.340
Clarus-san...

20:52.100 --> 20:53.430
Yuma-chan, where's our clothes!?

20:53.430 --> 20:55.560
Oh, uh... Over there!

21:05.990 --> 21:08.030
Shin-kun, It's dangerous.

21:08.030 --> 21:10.280
We haven't been given permission to go in yet!

21:10.280 --> 21:12.370
Then you can stay behind!

21:12.370 --> 21:14.030
I can't leave you either though.

21:14.030 --> 21:15.950
Hurry, Yuma-chan!

21:18.750 --> 21:20.370
Sh-Shingo-san.

21:20.370 --> 21:21.380
Matoi's daddy...

21:23.590 --> 21:25.340
Why are you here?

21:25.710 --> 21:28.800
Um... Um...

21:28.800 --> 21:31.260
Why are you evading the question? We've been exorcising—

21:31.260 --> 21:32.550
Yuma-chan!

21:34.970 --> 21:36.770
Here to gawk again?

21:37.730 --> 21:39.310
You were, weren't you?

21:39.310 --> 21:39.940
Why?

21:40.280 --> 21:42.860
I told you not to go to dangerous places!

21:43.520 --> 21:46.190
Shingo-san... Um...

21:46.190 --> 21:46.900
That's...

21:54.830 --> 21:55.910
Thank God.

21:58.250 --> 22:00.740
Thank God you're safe.

22:02.120 --> 22:03.130
Really...

22:04.500 --> 22:05.880
Thank God.

22:09.170 --> 22:10.760
Shingo-san.

22:17.140 --> 22:18.720
I'm sorry!

22:26.780 --> 22:28.940
Feeling your heart

22:28.940 --> 22:37.700
hito wa umarenagara hikari to kage wo

22:28.940 --> 22:37.700
It's natural for us all to be followed

22:37.700 --> 22:43.710
matoi tsuzukeru

22:37.700 --> 22:43.710
by light and shadow

22:43.710 --> 22:47.210
The lonely one

22:49.380 --> 22:51.420
Feeling your heart

22:51.420 --> 23:00.140
You can obtain all you've ever wanted

22:51.470 --> 23:00.180
hoshii mono subete te ni ireru koto

23:00.140 --> 23:06.400
sore ga shiawase nano

23:00.140 --> 23:06.400
But is that truly happiness?

23:06.400 --> 23:11.360
darekaga egao nara

23:06.400 --> 23:11.360
If someone is smiling,

23:11.360 --> 23:17.870
dokokade kitto naiteru hito ga ite

23:11.360 --> 23:17.870
somewhere, someone else is probably crying

23:17.870 --> 23:24.080
surechigau hodo itooshiku omou

23:17.870 --> 23:24.080
As our paths continue to cross,

23:24.080 --> 23:28.880
kimochi ga aru

23:24.080 --> 23:28.880
our love grows stronger

23:28.880 --> 23:33.880
hitotoki no aida ni

23:28.880 --> 23:33.880
In that short span of time

23:33.880 --> 23:40.390
bokura wa minna mujun wo dakishimete

23:33.880 --> 23:40.390
we embrace all contradictions

23:40.390 --> 23:48.520
as we watch the lights that lead us to tomorrow

23:40.430 --> 23:48.570
ashita e no hikari wo mitsume nagara

23:48.520 --> 23:53.700
aruiteku no kana

23:48.520 --> 23:53.700
I wonder if we'll keep walking this path

23:56.910 --> 23:58.200
Summer vacation!

23:58.200 --> 24:00.100
We all go to the sea,

24:00.100 --> 24:03.450
and it turns out it used to be a special place for Shingo-san and my mom.

24:03.450 --> 24:06.460
Next time, "The Sea, the Hot Springs, and the Sometimes Evil Spirits!"

24:06.870 --> 24:09.790
Oh, I get it! This is the fanservice episode!
